<title>FRANCE: France to issue new 10-year OAT on July 3.</title>
<headline>France to issue new 10-year OAT on July 3.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will issue a new 10-year government bond, a 5.50 percent October 25, 2007 OAT, at its next regular monthly auction on July 3 with a payment date of July 10, the Treasury said.  </p>
<p>The new bond has the same coupon as the current 10-year benchmark, an April 25, 2007 OAT.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
